* ---- int1 mb: CS=16p sampled input + 15x1p/side direct DAC, CI=8p ----
* SELP_j/SELN_j: 0/VDD level, unit j P-side left plate -> VP if SELP_j,
* else VN during PH2 (complement on N side: SELN_j=1 -> NP side to VP).
.subckt gf180_sdm3_int1_mb INP_S INN_S VCM_REF VP VN OUTP OUTN PH1 NPH1 PH2 NPH2 VDD33 VSS SP0 SP1 SP2 SP3 SP4 SP5 SP6 SP7 SP8 SP9 SP10 SP11 SP12 SP13 SP14 SN0 SN1 SN2 SN3 SN4 SN5 SN6 SN7 SN8 SN9 SN10 SN11 SN12 SN13 SN14 params: CS=16p CU=1p CI=8p W91=11u L91=2u W92=6u L92=2u W10=12u RSET=25k CC=10p
XOTA INP INN VCM_REF OUTP OUTN VDD33 VSS gf180_fd_ota_full2_nc W91={W91} L91={L91} W92={W92} L92={L92} W10={W10} RSET={RSET} CC={CC}
CSP CSLP CSRP {CS}
CSN CSLN CSRN {CS}
XS1A CSLP INP_S PH1 NPH1 VDD33 VSS gf180_tg_lowq
XS1B CSRP VCM_REF PH1 NPH1 VDD33 VSS gf180_tg_lowq
