* ---- modulator top: sdm3 timing, 4-bit flash + behavioral DWA ----
* Nodes: TH0..TH14 = thermometer lines (H_i). External PUP clock (narrow
* pulse at PH1 rising edge) advances the DWA master register.
.subckt gf180_sdm3_mod_mb VINP VINN VCM_REF VP VN PH1 NPH1 PH2 NPH2 CMPCK PUP VDD33 VSS TH0 TH1 TH2 TH3 TH4 TH5 TH6 TH7 TH8 TH9 TH10 TH11 TH12 TH13 TH14 params: RSET=25k CC=10p
XINT1 VINN VINP VCM_REF VP VN O1P O1N PH1 NPH1 PH2 NPH2 VDD33 VSS SEL0 SEL1 SEL2 SEL3 SEL4 SEL5 SEL6 SEL7 SEL8 SEL9 SEL10 SEL11 SEL12 SEL13 SEL14 SELN0 SELN1 SELN2 SELN3 SELN4 SELN5 SELN6 SELN7 SELN8 SELN9 SELN10 SELN11 SELN12 SELN13 SELN14 gf180_sdm3_int1_mb RSET={RSET} CC={CC}
* int2 with swapped clock pins (samples PH2 / integrates PH1)
XINT2 O1N O1P VCM_REF VP VN O2P O2N PH2 NPH2 PH1 NPH1 VDD33 VSS SEL20 SEL21 SEL22 SEL23 SEL24 SEL25 SEL26 SEL27 SEL28 SEL29 SEL210 SEL211 SEL212 SEL213 SEL214 SEL2N0 SEL2N1 SEL2N2 SEL2N3 SEL2N4 SEL2N5 SEL2N6 SEL2N7 SEL2N8 SEL2N9 SEL2N10 SEL2N11 SEL2N12 SEL2N13 SEL2N14 gf180_sdm3_int2_mb RSET={RSET} CC={CC}
XFLASH O2P O2N CMPCK VDD33 VSS TH0 TH1 TH2 TH3 TH4 TH5 TH6 TH7 TH8 TH9 TH10 TH11 TH12 TH13 TH14 gf180_sdm3_flash15
* thermometer count as voltage (1 V per count)
BCSUM CSUM 0 V=(v(TH0)+v(TH1)+v(TH2)+v(TH3)+v(TH4)+v(TH5)+v(TH6)+v(TH7)+v(TH8)+v(TH9)+v(TH10)+v(TH11)+v(TH12)+v(TH13)+v(TH14))/v(VDD33)
* DWA pointer: master samples mod(p_slave - c + 15) during PUP,
* slave tracks master during PH2. p[n+1]=(p[n]-c[n]) mod 15.
BNEXT PNEXT 0 V=v(PTRS)-v(CSUM)+15
BNEXTM PNEXTM 0 V=v(PNEXT)-15*floor(v(PNEXT)/15)
BPTRM0 PTRM 0 V=0
CPTRM PTRM VSS 0.5p
RPTRM PTRM VSS 1G
BPTRS0 PTRS 0 V=0
CPTRS PTRS VSS 0.5p
RPTRS PTRS VSS 1G
*
* int1 unit selects (DWA): P-side unit j -> VP if rot(j-p) < 15-c
BSEL0 SEL0 0 V=(((15-v(PTRS))-15*floor((15-v(PTRS))/15)) < (15-v(CSUM)) ? v(VDD33) : 0)
BSELN0 SELN0 0 V=(((15-v(PTRS))-15*floor((15-v(PTRS))/15)) >= (15-v(CSUM)) ? v(VDD33) : 0)
BSEL1 SEL1 0 V=(((16-v(PTRS))-15*floor((16-v(PTRS))/15)) < (15-v(CSUM)) ? v(VDD33) : 0)
BSELN1 SELN1 0 V=(((16-v(PTRS))-15*floor((16-v(PTRS))/15)) >= (15-v(CSUM)) ? v(VDD33) : 0)
BSEL2 SEL2 0 V=(((17-v(PTRS))-15*floor((17-v(PTRS))/15)) < (15-v(CSUM)) ? v(VDD33) : 0)
BSELN2 SELN2 0 V=(((17-v(PTRS))-15*floor((17-v(PTRS))/15)) >= (15-v(CSUM)) ? v(VDD33) : 0)
BSEL3 SEL3 0 V=(((18-v(PTRS))-15*floor((18-v(PTRS))/15)) < (15-v(CSUM)) ? v(VDD33) : 0)
BSELN3 SELN3 0 V=(((18-v(PTRS))-15*floor((18-v(PTRS))/15)) >= (15-v(CSUM)) ? v(VDD33) : 0)
BSEL4 SEL4 0 V=(((19-v(PTRS))-15*floor((19-v(PTRS))/15)) < (15-v(CSUM)) ? v(VDD33) : 0)
BSELN4 SELN4 0 V=(((19-v(PTRS))-15*floor((19-v(PTRS))/15)) >= (15-v(CSUM)) ? v(VDD33) : 0)
BSEL5 SEL5 0 V=(((20-v(PTRS))-15*floor((20-v(PTRS))/15)) < (15-v(CSUM)) ? v(VDD33) : 0)
BSELN5 SELN5 0 V=(((20-v(PTRS))-15*floor((20-v(PTRS))/15)) >= (15-v(CSUM)) ? v(VDD33) : 0)
BSEL6 SEL6 0 V=(((21-v(PTRS))-15*floor((21-v(PTRS))/15)) < (15-v(CSUM)) ? v(VDD33) : 0)
BSELN6 SELN6 0 V=(((21-v(PTRS))-15*floor((21-v(PTRS))/15)) >= (15-v(CSUM)) ? v(VDD33) : 0)
BSEL7 SEL7 0 V=(((22-v(PTRS))-15*floor((22-v(PTRS))/15)) < (15-v(CSUM)) ? v(VDD33) : 0)
BSELN7 SELN7 0 V=(((22-v(PTRS))-15*floor((22-v(PTRS))/15)) >= (15-v(CSUM)) ? v(VDD33) : 0)
BSEL8 SEL8 0 V=(((23-v(PTRS))-15*floor((23-v(PTRS))/15)) < (15-v(CSUM)) ? v(VDD33) : 0)
BSELN8 SELN8 0 V=(((23-v(PTRS))-15*floor((23-v(PTRS))/15)) >= (15-v(CSUM)) ? v(VDD33) : 0)
BSEL9 SEL9 0 V=(((24-v(PTRS))-15*floor((24-v(PTRS))/15)) < (15-v(CSUM)) ? v(VDD33) : 0)
BSELN9 SELN9 0 V=(((24-v(PTRS))-15*floor((24-v(PTRS))/15)) >= (15-v(CSUM)) ? v(VDD33) : 0)
BSEL10 SEL10 0 V=(((25-v(PTRS))-15*floor((25-v(PTRS))/15)) < (15-v(CSUM)) ? v(VDD33) : 0)
BSELN10 SELN10 0 V=(((25-v(PTRS))-15*floor((25-v(PTRS))/15)) >= (15-v(CSUM)) ? v(VDD33) : 0)
BSEL11 SEL11 0 V=(((26-v(PTRS))-15*floor((26-v(PTRS))/15)) < (15-v(CSUM)) ? v(VDD33) : 0)
BSELN11 SELN11 0 V=(((26-v(PTRS))-15*floor((26-v(PTRS))/15)) >= (15-v(CSUM)) ? v(VDD33) : 0)
BSEL12 SEL12 0 V=(((27-v(PTRS))-15*floor((27-v(PTRS))/15)) < (15-v(CSUM)) ? v(VDD33) : 0)
BSELN12 SELN12 0 V=(((27-v(PTRS))-15*floor((27-v(PTRS))/15)) >= (15-v(CSUM)) ? v(VDD33) : 0)
BSEL13 SEL13 0 V=(((28-v(PTRS))-15*floor((28-v(PTRS))/15)) < (15-v(CSUM)) ? v(VDD33) : 0)
BSELN13 SELN13 0 V=(((28-v(PTRS))-15*floor((28-v(PTRS))/15)) >= (15-v(CSUM)) ? v(VDD33) : 0)
BSEL14 SEL14 0 V=(((29-v(PTRS))-15*floor((29-v(PTRS))/15)) < (15-v(CSUM)) ? v(VDD33) : 0)
BSELN14 SELN14 0 V=(((29-v(PTRS))-15*floor((29-v(PTRS))/15)) >= (15-v(CSUM)) ? v(VDD33) : 0)
* int2 code register: tracks CSUM during PH2, holds through PH1
SC2 CSUM C2R PH2 VSS idsw
CC2R C2R VSS 0.5p
RC2R C2R VSS 1G
* int2 unit selects (straight thermometer from registered code)
BSEL20 SEL20 0 V=((0 < (15-v(C2R))) ? v(VDD33) : 0)
BSEL2N0 SEL2N0 0 V=((0 >= (15-v(C2R))) ? v(VDD33) : 0)
BSEL21 SEL21 0 V=((1 < (15-v(C2R))) ? v(VDD33) : 0)
